WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.920
[Knock at door]

2
00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:02.000
Nick?

3
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.000
It’s Mummy and Daddy, dear.

4
00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:18.720
Welcome to Casa de Nick.

5
00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.720
Your mother thought  she'd just pop over,

6
00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:30.960
and check the place out.

7
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:32.640
Come on, let's go.

8
00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:34.720
What's wrong, Mum?

9
00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:38.160
Aww. Tears of joy...

10
00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:40.480
To see her son doing so well.

11
00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:40.920
Stop it!

12
00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:41.840
Be strong.

13
00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.520
No, I'm fine.

14
00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:45.960
Just overwhelmed at how...

15
00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:47.440
lovely your place is.

16
00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:50.040
Cool.

17
00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:51.840
Well, let me give  you the grand tour.

18
00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:57.000
This is the kitchen.

19
00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.680
This is the living room.

20
00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:02.280
This is the dining room.

21
00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:05.760
This is the master bedroom.

22
00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:07.360
So many rooms.

23
00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:11.600
And where’s the loo?

24
00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:13.200
Oh, dear God.

25
00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:14.720
No, Mum.

26
00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:16.800
That's just for the  leak in the ceiling.

27
00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:18.320
Loo’s through there.

28
00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:19.800
Of course.

29
00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:21.840
I'll just go and freshen up.

30
00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:23.040
Hold on.

31
00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:24.040
What are you doing?

32
00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:25.000
Well, I've only got one bulb,

33
00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:26.520
so I have to move it  from room to room.

34
00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:28.520
Never mind.

35
00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:31.160
Eugh. I'm fine.

36
00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:33.840
Cool, eh?

37
00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:36.360
You know, I’m thinking of  making a few improvements.

38
00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:38.280
Maybe taking out this wall.

39
00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:41.880
You do that one more time  and you’re a dead man.

40
00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:45.320
Good old Viv.

41
00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:47.480
It’s that sort of relationship.

42
00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:49.280
Anyone for tea?

43
00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:51.360
Oh, lovely. That would be nice. No! Lovely...

44
00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:56.280
Oh, I've missed you.

45
00:01:57.280 --> 00:01:58.440
I've missed you.

46
00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:01.440
I don't believe it.

47
00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:04.080
My son is struggling to survive in this desolate hellhole,

48
00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:05.680
and all you're going  to do is watch the telly.

49
00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:08.120
I’m not going to  watch it, Susan.

50
00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:09.240
I'm going to take it home.

51
00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:10.520
The telly’s not the only  thing that's coming home.

52
00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:11.440
No, no you don't.

53
00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:12.560
No way.

54
00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:14.200
No. For the first  time in his life,

55
00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:15.680
Nick is standing on  his own two feet.

56
00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:17.640
But he's standing  in excrement!

57
00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:18.800
[Knocking on door]

58
00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:20.160
Get down!

59
00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:24.800
Don’t make any noise.

60
00:02:24.800 --> 00:02:26.320
Hey, Harper.

61
00:02:26.320 --> 00:02:27.760
You owe me rent.

62
00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:30.600
I know you're in there.

63
00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:34.360
I saw the light, you lazy  son of a pig's nipple.

64
00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:36.440
For your information,

65
00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:39.480
that's the pig's nipple  you're referring to.

66
00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:41.600
And no one is allowed to  speak about my son that way,

67
00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:42.440
except me.

68
00:02:42.440 --> 00:02:43.640
I've earned it.

69
00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:44.000
Dad-

70
00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:45.440
It’s alright, Nick.  I'll handle this.

71
00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:48.120
And as far as a shameful  excuse for a flat goes,

72
00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:50.480
you're very lucky to get a  penny of his hard-earned money.

73
00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:50.840
But, Dad-

74
00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:51.680
Quiet, Nick.

75
00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:54.160
So, the next time you ask for rent, I suggest you ask politely.

76
00:02:54.160 --> 00:02:57.040
Believe me, you don't want  me on your bad side.

77
00:02:57.040 --> 00:02:58.680
I'm a dentist.

78
00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:01.680
Oh, Ben.

79
00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:03.560
That was wonderful.

80
00:03:03.560 --> 00:03:05.680
Except the part about  the pig's nipple.

81
00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:08.520
There's no reason to  shout at Nick like that.

82
00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:11.520
Actually, he has.  I lost my job at the pub.

83
00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:13.320
I'm a week behind  on my rent,

84
00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:14.800
and I haven't eaten  for two days.

85
00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:15.560
Ohhh!

86
00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:16.800
Well, if there's  anything we can do.

87
00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:18.880
Come on, Susan, let's go.  Sounds like Nick's busy.

88
00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:22.880
So, are you gonna pay?

89
00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:24.200
No, he's coming  home with us.

90
00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:25.400
Cool, I'll just  get my things.

91
00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:26.880
No!

92
00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:28.200
Wait.

93
00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:30.200
Let's just think about  this because, look...

94
00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:32.200
What sort of lesson  would it be if we let Nick

95
00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:35.600
give up every time  life gets difficult?

96
00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:37.960
You know, I mean, if it means me having to pay a month's rent

97
00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:40.080
just to keep him here,

98
00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:42.000
that's a sacrifice I'm willing to make.

99
00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:45.040
And 100 up front to  cover the damages. Cash.

100
00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:46.280
Yep, yep. Fine. Fine.

101
00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:47.320
Damages?

102
00:03:47.320 --> 00:03:49.880
This flat is a masterpiece.

103
00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:51.400
As a matter of fact,  when I get home,

104
00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:53.440
I'm gonna do up the  entire house just like it.

105
00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:56.640
Hurry up with  the money, dear.

106
00:03:56.640 --> 00:03:58.560
Cheque for the rent  will be in the post.

107
00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:00.480
Bye, dear.

108
00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:02.880
Love what you've  done with the place.

109
00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:12.040
Thanks, mate.

110
00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:13.560
Same time next month?
